{"artifact_id": "EXM-04", "chunk_id": "EXM-04:sec:PURPOSE", "content_sha256": "756709503fad7ffdd56120f4c8bf46e04f2cf833751ec151b616a2e7468eb5ed", "heading": "Purpose", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-04", "artifact_version": 1.1, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-017", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "2cb92fe5f56d22f1b231c129a7e0dbc27bf86007", "syllabai_resources": "6162cc770e8391e4a76d68919b88fd9f23081ce9"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "# EXM-04 — What Examiners Penalize"}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-04", "chunk_id": "EXM-04:sec:PURPOSE", "content_sha256": "fcc99dde530077a2be399cc7a93e92a87336ef678579930e084704292f03d7ee", "heading": "Purpose", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-04", "artifact_version": 1.1, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-017", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "2cb92fe5f56d22f1b231c129a7e0dbc27bf86007", "syllabai_resources": "6162cc770e8391e4a76d68919b88fd9f23081ce9"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Purpose\n\nThis artifact catalogues what the official 4CH1 examiner reports identify as penalised\nor mark-losing behaviour, as held in the corpus of record (SRC-ER-4CH1): failed\ninstructions, inattentive formulae work, unread methods, unlinked statements, quantity\nconfusions and notation misuse. Every claim is carried on a bounded, page-located\nexcerpt from the run's evidence pack, with paper/session identity preserved. Research\nartifact; canonical planes untouched."}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-04", "chunk_id": "EXM-04:sec:SCOPE", "content_sha256": "a7e2fae07dd96ad77672c7bf001bcf8d88bae0a80982eaeed74c67a1d4c78d15", "heading": "Scope", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-04", "artifact_version": 1.1, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-017", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "2cb92fe5f56d22f1b231c129a7e0dbc27bf86007", "syllabai_resources": "6162cc770e8391e4a76d68919b88fd9f23081ce9"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Scope\n\n**Covers:** instruction-following failures; formula and subscript care; method-reading\nfailures; unlinked-explanation losses; proton/mass-number confusions; notation misuse.\n\n**Grounding:** SRC-ER-4CH1 (the 2023-11 1C/2C, 2024-06 1CR/2C/2CR, 2024-11 1C/2C and 2025-06 1C/1CR/2C/2CR report excerpts of the pack).\n\n**Out of scope:** mark-scheme-derived loss patterns (MS-05's ground); warnings\nframing (EXM-02)."}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-04", "chunk_id": "EXM-04:sec:EXECUTIVE_SUMMARY", "content_sha256": "f6bd70b17ba54a458667a79ce130b82b7d0b76c9fa720cf06dd25c7147fd8c93", "heading": "Executive Summary", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-04", "artifact_version": 1.1, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-017", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "2cb92fe5f56d22f1b231c129a7e0dbc27bf86007", "syllabai_resources": "6162cc770e8391e4a76d68919b88fd9f23081ce9"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Executive Summary\n\nThe reports are specific about losses. Candidates lose marks for not following\nprinted instructions (the particle-drawing count), for inattention to the starting\nformula in organic work and unclear subscripts, for not reading (or not understanding)\nthe method's variable-control logic, for failing to LINK statements in multi-mark\nexplanations, for reaching for the mass number when the atomic number is wanted, and\nfor misusing notation. The pattern beneath the specifics: the examiners penalise\ninattention — to the question's own words, to the chemistry's symbols, and to the\nmethod's design — more than they penalise absence of knowledge."}
